Document.description_en:
Pearson International Fuel Facilities Corporation (PIFFC) is the owner of fuel storage installations located on Tank Farm Road at YYZ Pearson International Airport in Mississauga, ON that supply jet fuel to the airport.

&nbsp;

As part of this proposed project,&nbsp;PIFFC&nbsp;will decommission the existing fuel storage installations and conduct remediation at the site. The work will consist primarily of dismantling and removing all underground and aboveground fuel storage tanks and all associated piping, equipment, structural foundations and buildings at the site. Environmental remediation work will be completed in conjunction with the decommissioning of these installations.

Document.description_fr:
Pearson International Fuel Facilities Corporation (PIFFC) est le propri&eacute;taire des infrastructures d&#39;un parc de r&eacute;servoirs de carburant situ&eacute; sur la rue Tank Farm &agrave; YYZ a&eacute;roport Pearson de Toronto, qui fournit du carburant d&#39;aviation &agrave; l&#39;a&eacute;roport.

&nbsp;

Dans le cadre du projet propos&eacute;, PIFFC pr&eacute;voit d&eacute;manteler ses installations actuelles de stockage de carburant et r&eacute;alisera des travaux de r&eacute;habilitation.&nbsp; Les travaux comprendront principalement le d&eacute;mant&egrave;lement et l&#39;enl&egrave;vement des r&eacute;servoirs hors sol et souterrains ainsi que l&#39;ensemble des tuyauteries, &eacute;quipements, des bases structurelles, et des b&acirc;timents associ&eacute;s sur le site. Les travaux de r&eacute;habilitation seront r&eacute;alis&eacute;s en parall&egrave;le avec le d&eacute;mant&egrave;lement de ces infrastructures.

